    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reach your destination using <u>only words!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pilot and a navigator must work together to fly the plane. The pilot watches the screen and controls the aircraft, while the navigator reads a physical map. Since neither can see the other\u2019s information, only sharp communication will get you there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/9eab26ac18dc85459dc0965e8b8cc760.poster.avif?t=1755651867\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/9eab26ac18dc85459dc0965e8b8cc760.webm?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/9eab26ac18dc85459dc0965e8b8cc760.mp4?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Replays let you relive the flight!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate success. Or laugh at moments like \u201cWait, that\u2019s what you heard!?\u201d and those unexpected detours.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/778e622affa0e88da3a66a49d39a8f78.poster.avif?t=1755651867\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/778e622affa0e88da3a66a49d39a8f78.webm?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/778e622affa0e88da3a66a49d39a8f78.mp4?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use every sight and sound as your guide!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the cockpit, the pilot can spot mountains, lakes, and other landmarks to navigate. Entering certain airspaces triggers unique sounds as audio clues. With each player seeing different information and clues, clear communication is key to a successful flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/1b203629469d4fb6e2f1dedd0344d3d6.poster.avif?t=1755651867\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/1b203629469d4fb6e2f1dedd0344d3d6.webm?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/1b203629469d4fb6e2f1dedd0344d3d6.mp4?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Boost immersion with a paper map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Print out the custom map, mix and match the pieces, and explore fresh terrain every time. The mix of paper and digital creates a unique, hands-on play experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/4eee6663442d01fcd9b3a3715546cd3a.poster.avif?t=1755651867\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/4eee6663442d01fcd9b3a3715546cd3a.webm?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/4eee6663442d01fcd9b3a3715546cd3a.mp4?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play anywhere with your own conversation style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the Radio is designed for local play, but with voice chat or a call app, you can enjoy it even when you're far apart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*The navigator just needs the map; only the pilot runs the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Replays are pilot-only, but you can share the screen via a call app to watch together.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reach your destination using <u>only words!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pilot and a navigator must work together to fly the plane. The pilot watches the screen and controls the aircraft, while the navigator reads a physical map. Since neither can see the other\u2019s information, only sharp communication will get you there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/9eab26ac18dc85459dc0965e8b8cc760.poster.avif?t=1755651867\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/9eab26ac18dc85459dc0965e8b8cc760.webm?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/9eab26ac18dc85459dc0965e8b8cc760.mp4?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Replays let you relive the flight!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate success. Or laugh at moments like \u201cWait, that\u2019s what you heard!?\u201d and those unexpected detours.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/778e622affa0e88da3a66a49d39a8f78.poster.avif?t=1755651867\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/778e622affa0e88da3a66a49d39a8f78.webm?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/778e622affa0e88da3a66a49d39a8f78.mp4?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use every sight and sound as your guide!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the cockpit, the pilot can spot mountains, lakes, and other landmarks to navigate. Entering certain airspaces triggers unique sounds as audio clues. With each player seeing different information and clues, clear communication is key to a successful flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/1b203629469d4fb6e2f1dedd0344d3d6.poster.avif?t=1755651867\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/1b203629469d4fb6e2f1dedd0344d3d6.webm?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/1b203629469d4fb6e2f1dedd0344d3d6.mp4?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Boost immersion with a paper map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Print out the custom map, mix and match the pieces, and explore fresh terrain every time. The mix of paper and digital creates a unique, hands-on play experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/4eee6663442d01fcd9b3a3715546cd3a.poster.avif?t=1755651867\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/4eee6663442d01fcd9b3a3715546cd3a.webm?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/4eee6663442d01fcd9b3a3715546cd3a.mp4?t=1755651867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play anywhere with your own conversation style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the Radio is designed for local play, but with voice chat or a call app, you can enjoy it even when you're far apart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*The navigator just needs the map; only the pilot runs the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Replays are pilot-only, but you can share the screen via a call app to watch together.</i></p>",
